 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Shadows!
     Author: Jonas Nordin
   Comments: Made for playing lead in shadows like tunes (live)
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO. B: 86
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A	123456
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B	123456
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       ****56
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       1*3*56
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 8.00 kHz
   HI LEVEL +8.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 2.98 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 346 Hz
     L.M. Q 2.3
 L.M. LEVEL -3.0 dB
 
    LO FREQ 250 Hz
   LO LEVEL -6.0 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL +8.5 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-6 NOISE SUPPRESSOR
 
    SENS 100
 RELEASE 65
   LEVEL 100
 
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-1 SHORT DELAY
 
  D. TIME 100 msec
 E. LEVEL 36
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-3 AUTO PANPOT
 
  RATE 80
 DEPTH 70
  MODE trem
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-5 REVERB
 
 DECAY 4.0 sec
 
 MODE: SPRING 1
 
    CUTOFF THRU
 PRE DELAY 0 msec
  E. LEVEL 22
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-6 LINEOUT FILTER
 
 PRESENCE 35
   TREBLE 80
   MIDDLE 70
     BASS 80
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 100
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF

 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1

